@startuml
title State diagram for the Ott Based System Mini Reel class

[*] --> NotLoggedIn

state "Not logged in" as NotLoggedIn
state "Logged In" as LoggedIn
state "Video Watching" as VideoWatching
state "Video Uploading" as VideoUploading
state "Likes List" as LikesList
state "Discussion Option" as DiscussionOption

NotLoggedIn --> LoggedIn : Login
LoggedIn --> VideoWatching : Watch Videos
VideoWatching --> LikesList : Save to likes list
LikesList --> VideoWatching : View saved videos
VideoWatching --> DiscussionOption : Enter discussion option
DiscussionOption --> [*]

VideoUploading --> LoggedIn : Upload video
LoggedIn --> VideoUploading : Upload video

@enduml
